<title>USA: Dell Computer says has two-for-one split.</title>
<headline>Dell Computer says has two-for-one split.</headline>
<dateline>ROUND ROCK, Texas 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dell Computer Corp said on Tuesday that its directors had declared a two-for-one stock split to be paid in the form of a 100-percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend is to be issued on July 25 to shareholders of record on July 18, Dell said in a statement.</p>
<p>The split, which is subject to shareholder approval at Dell's annual meeting on July 18, would be the company's fourth in the last five years, Dell said.</p>
<p>Dell Computer Corp is a Fortune 500 computer systems company.</p>
</text>
